{id:'slickback',n:'Slick Back',len:'medium',types:['straight','wavy'],faces:['oval','square','oblong','diamond'],maint:'medium',cut:4,occ:['formal','wedding','office','party'],d:'Hair combed straight back with shine for a sleek, polished look.',ask:'Taper on the sides, 7–9 cm all over the top so it lies back smoothly.',style:'Comb back while damp with pomade; blow dry for more volume or let it set for a wet look.',prod:'High-shine pomade, fine comb'},
{id:'undercut',n:'Undercut',len:'medium',types:['straight','wavy'],faces:['oval','round','square','diamond'],maint:'medium',cut:3,occ:['party','date','college'],d:'Very short sides and back with a long top and a clear disconnection, styled back or to the side.',ask:'Number 1 on the sides and back with no blending, 10–12 cm on top, disconnected.',style:'Blow dry back or to the side and finish with pomade or clay.',prod:'Pomade or clay'},
{id:'taperfade',n:'Taper Fade',len:'short',types:['straight','wavy','curly','coily'],faces:['oval','round','square','oblong','heart','diamond'],maint:'low',cut:2,occ:['office','college','party','interview'],d:'Short top with sides that fade smoothly from skin to hair. Tidy and easy to keep.',ask:'Low or mid skin taper fade, 3–4 cm on top, natural shape kept at the front.',style:'Brush or sponge the top into shape; a little cream on dry hair.',prod:'Light cream or brush'},
{id:'middlepart',n:'Middle Part (Curtains)',len:'medium',types:['straight','wavy'],faces:['oblong','heart','diamond','oval'],maint:'medium',cut:6,occ:['college','date','brunch'],d:'Hair parted down the middle and falling to both sides like curtains. Soft and youthful.',ask:'Keep length all over, 10–12 cm at the front, sides scissor-cut and left long over the ears.',style:'Blow dry with a centre part, using a round brush to curve each side away from the face.',prod:'Sea salt spray, light cream'},
{id:'curlytop',n:'Curly Top Fade',len:'short',types:['curly','wavy'],faces:['oval','round','oblong','heart','diamond'],maint:'medium',cut:3,occ:['college','date','party'],d:'Natural curls kept on top with a clean fade on the sides. Lets your curls do the work.',ask:'Mid skin fade, 5–7 cm of curls on top, shaped dry so curls sit where they fall.',style:'Apply curl cream to wet hair, scrunch and air dry or diffuse. Don’t brush once dry.',prod:'Curl cream, diffuser'},
{id:'afro',n:'Afro',len:'medium',types:['coily','curly'],faces:['oval','oblong','heart','diamond'],maint:'high',cut:6,occ:['party','college','date'],d:'Full, rounded natural volume all around. Healthy and striking.',ask:'Shape it into an even round silhouette, trim the ends and tidy the edges and neckline.',style:'Moisturise daily, pick out from the roots for volume, and sleep on a satin pillowcase.',prod:'Leave-in conditioner, oil, afro pick'},
{id:'twists',n:'Twists',len:'short',types:['coily','curly'],faces:['oval','round','square','oblong'],maint:'medium',cut:4,occ:['college','party','travel'],d:'Short two-strand or sponge twists on top with a faded side.',ask:'Low taper fade on the sides, 4–6 cm on top for twists, with a lined-up edge.',style:'Twist with a sponge or by hand using twisting cream; refresh every few days.',prod:'Twisting cream, curl sponge'},
{id:'manbun',n:'Man Bun',len:'long',types:['straight','wavy','curly'],faces:['oval','square','oblong','diamond'],maint:'medium',cut:8,occ:['brunch','travel','date'],d:'Long hair pulled back and tied in a bun at the crown. Practical for growing out hair.',ask:'Keep the length; ask for dusting the ends and tidying the sides so they tie back neatly.',style:'Brush back, tie with a soft band at the crown, and leave a little looseness at the front.',prod:'Light cream, soft hair ties'},
{id:'longflow',n:'Long Flow',len:'long',types:['straight','wavy'],faces:['oval','heart','diamond','square'],maint:'medium',cut:8,occ:['brunch','date','travel'],d:'Chin to neck length hair swept back and tucked behind the ears. Relaxed and confident.',ask:'Trim the ends only, add light layers for movement, and keep the back slightly shorter.',style:'Sea salt spray on damp hair, push back with your fingers and air dry.',prod:'Sea salt spray, leave-in conditioner'},
{id:'shoulder',n:'Shoulder-length Hair',len:'long',types:['straight','wavy','curly'],faces:['oval','heart','diamond','oblong'],maint:'high',cut:10,occ:['brunch','party','travel'],d:'Long, layered hair worn loose to the shoulders with a middle part.',ask:'Long layers to remove weight, ends trimmed, middle part kept natural.',style:'Condition well, air dry with a little cream, and avoid daily heat.',prod:'Conditioner, hair oil, wide comb'},
{id:'mullet',n:'Modern Mullet',len:'medium',types:['straight','wavy','curly'],faces:['oval','oblong','heart'],maint:'medium',cut:4,occ:['party','college'],d:'Short textured front and sides with longer hair at the back. A bold comeback cut.',ask:'Taper the sides, 4–5 cm textured on top, keep 8–10 cm at the back of the neck.',style:'Texture spray on the top, let the back fall naturally.',prod:'Texture spray'}
